From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kompakt: the media card on the lock screen and in the shade

Lockscreen media card.

Lockscreen media card as Katapult's.

No media player in quick settings.

The notifications shade shows the media card.

The media card has a round open button.

The shade media card paints with the notifications.

The media card open dot and even slots.

The media card open dot is the stop square's width.
